  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\"><strong>&nbsp;冰封紀元</strong></span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;color:#999;font-size:18px\">《冰封紀元》是一款在保留經典 Minecraft 風格的同時，加入大量新功能的模組。它新增了可愛毛茸茸的爬行動物：奇魯獸、企鵝、馴鹿，並重製了冰屋等更多內容！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#808080;font-size:18px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\"><strong>此模組同時支援 Fabric 與 Forge，<span style=\"color:#f00\">暫無回溯至舊版本的計畫。</span></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">欲了解本模組的所有精彩內容，請查閱<strong>維基頁面</strong>！或瀏覽<strong>圖片</strong>區塊快速概覽！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/724626462996561990/1049760411634905178/frozen_up.png\"><br><br><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;font-size:18px;color:#808080\">若您喜歡遊玩此模組，歡迎加入我的<strong>Discord 伺服器</strong>！這是我打造的小天地，您可在此參與社群交流或窺探開發中的專案：&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#000;text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/fT4MKzUTZS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/fT4MKzUTZS</a></span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fNinni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;color:#808080\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#000;text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/957828687233966110/1040015304048255037/image.png\" width=\"1135\" height=\"333\"></span></span></strong></span></a></span></p>",
